message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Datacenter IP ranges"
abstract: >-
  Daily list of cloud, hosting and CDN IP ranges collected from the official
  feeds of AWS, Google, Oracle Cloud, DigitalOcean, Akamai Cloud (Linode),
  Vultr, Cloudflare, Fastly and GitHub, with Tor exit nodes and iCloud Private
  Relay egress kept as separate categories.
